            "heading": "Features",
            "feat_icon_1": "shelf",
            "feat_title_1": "Removable Beech Wood Trimmed Racks",
            "feat_image_1": "shopify://shop_images/11zoom_back_panel.jpg",
            "feat_content_1": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets are outfitted with sleek wire racks<br/>with a beautiful beech wood trim. The shelves effortlessly slide out, providing easy access to your wine collection.</p><p>This also helps to keep the bottles properly organized and makes it easier to find the right bottle.</p>",
            "feat_icon_2": "led-lighting",
            "feat_title_2": "LED Lighting",
            "feat_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/168VN.jpg",
            "feat_content_2": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets come with a cold LED light, that cooly<br/>displays your wine collection in a classic and elegant manner.</p><p>The LED light has a very low energy consumption and is the safest method of lighting wine.</p><p>The LED light can be turned on or off at your discretion.</p>",
            "feat_icon_3": "glass-door",
            "feat_title_3": "3 Layer Tempered Glass Door",
            "feat_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/Picture6_6517b4e4-9925-4f2c-9edf-ac05b7b15d88.jpg",
            "feat_content_3": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets are equipped with a 3-layer tempered glass door, curated with a special heat-treating process. This process makes the glass stronger and offers more protection to your wine collection.</p><p>The 3-layer tempered glass also helps maintain stability within the cabinet, maintaining temperature and humidity at the appropriate levels, as well as offering protection from UV radiation.</p>",
            "feat_icon_4": "temperature",
            "feat_title_4": "Precise And Consistent Temperature",
            "feat_image_4": "shopify://shop_images/1_03b12dfe-1dca-4c46-8518-c76b188b7aac.jpg",
            "feat_content_4": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets are equipped with an automated temperature monitoring system, so the cabinet can maintain the appropriate internal temperature, despite any external temperature changes.</p><p>LeCavist cabinets employ sensors to constantly monitor<br/>internal and external temperatures, and the automated system will adjust the internal temperature accordingly.</p>",
